    "text": "Let,&nbsp;<math> <mrow> <mtext>y</mtext> <mo>=</mo> <mfrac> <mrow> <msup> <mtext>x</mtext> <mn>2</mn> </msup> <mo>-</mo> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mtext>a</mtext> <mo>+</mo> <mtext>b</mtext> </mrow> </mfenced> <mtext>x</mtext> <mo>+</mo> <mtext>ab</mtext> </mrow> <mrow> <mtext>x</mtext> <mo>-</mo> <mtext>c</mtext> </mrow> </mfrac> </mrow> </math><br /><br /><math> <mrow> <mo>⇒</mo> <mtext>yx</mtext> <mo>-</mo> <mtext>cy</mtext> <mo>=</mo> <msup> <mtext>x</mtext> <mn>2</mn> </msup> <mo>-</mo> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mtext>a</mtext> <mo>+</mo> <mtext>b</mtext> </mrow> </mfenced> <mtext>x</mtext> <mo>+</mo> <mtext>ab</mtext> </mrow> </math><br /><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><br />For real roots, <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><br /><math> <mrow> <mo>⇒</mo> <msup> <mrow> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mtext>a</mtext> <mo>+</mo> <mtext>b</mtext> <mo>+</mo> <mtext>y</mtext> </mrow> </mfenced> </mrow> <mn>2</mn> </msup> <mo>-</mo> <mn>4</mn> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mtext>ab</mtext> <mo>+</mo> <mtext>cy</mtext> </mrow> </mfenced> <mo>≥</mo> <mn>0</mn> </mrow> </math><br /><br /><math> <mrow> <mo>⇒</mo> <msup> <mrow> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mtext>a</mtext> <mo>+</mo> <mtext>b</mtext> </mrow> </mfenced> </mrow> <mn>2</mn> </msup> <mo>+</mo> <msup> <mtext>y</mtext> <mn>2</mn> </msup> <mo>+</mo> <mn>2</mn> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mtext>a</mtext> <mo>+</mo> <mtext>b</mtext> </mrow> </mfenced> <mtext>y</mtext> <mo>-</mo> <mn>4</mn> <mtext>ab</mtext> <mo>-</mo> <mn>4</mn> <mtext>cy</mtext> <mo>≥</mo> <mn>0</mn> </mrow> </math><br /><br /><math> <mrow> <mo>⇒</mo> <msup> <mtext>y</mtext> <mn>2</mn> </msup> <mo>+</mo> <mn>2</mn> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mtext>a</mtext> <mo>+</mo> <mtext>b</mtext> <mo>-</mo> <mn>2</mn> <mtext>c</mtext> </mrow> </mfenced> <mtext>y</mtext> <mo>+</mo> <msup> <mrow> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mtext>a</mtext> <mo>-</mo> <mtext>b</mtext> </mrow> </mfenced> </mrow> <mn>2</mn> </msup> <mo>≥</mo> <mn>0</mn> </mrow> </math><br /><br />which is true for all real values of <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></math> if<br />&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><br />&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<math><mo>⇒</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>≤</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><br />&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <math><mo>⇒</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>≤</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><br 